     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This is largely outside what I know and practice. I never really use the gcc debugger, and would rather just print elements to the console if need be (I&#39;ve never found those debuggers to be terribly useful anyway). Might be better to post a Q like this on stack overflow.<div><br></div><div>Phil</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
