     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you for your reply Phil .<br><br>By printing on console you meant R console? If you mean R console then internal functions which are used in the c++ functions say &quot;determinant&quot; function imported from Armadillo library , I wont be able to see that. </div>"
